Installation
============

From Source
-----------
No Makefile is supplied with this copy: there is nothing to install.
The application finds its files in the current folder, so start it from
its own folder:

    cd examples/pfontview && ./main

The binary defaults to gtk3sermo. To use another one, set GTKDIALOG:

    GTKDIALOG=qt6sermo ./main

Requirements
============

gtk3sermo >= 1.0.0 (fork of gtkdialog 0.8.2 - https://haplo-dialog.fr)
fc-query - part of fontconfig - http://fontconfig.org/

Execution
=========

Usage: pfontview [FILE]

Where FILE is a TrueType font file.

Operation
=========

Save Settings will additionally save the window dimensions.

If you have Pfont2 or Sfontview installed then you will be able to
access them via the Tools menu.

